{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>This day you go out in the month of the Aviv.</b> In this year it happened that the lunar month of your departure fell in the month of the Aviv. Therefore keep this day, and make intercalation of the year, so that this month forever falls in the Aviv, in which you celebrate this festival."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:17.204970185Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}